// SaysList :
"P3703953609" "<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor purple>HELP! {HeroName}! I'm... I'm still alive! I... she sacrificed herself to free me... Psyche flung me out of her body!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor purple>I'm trapped in a crystal within an urn. One of Darrin Wade's lackeys just arrived, she knows I'm here! She wants to sacrifice me to power Darrin Wade!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor purple>We can still do this... if you weaken the lackey... and free me... yes...!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor purple>I can jump into the lackey's body, but only if you weaken whoever it is and free me!"

