// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Actor1 :
"P94083986" "<em FemStandtoReact><t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>Justin... something... something isn't right!"
// 4 Actor2 :
"P3560396041" "<em MaleStandtoLookUp><t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>What is it?!"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P3746958927" "<t=6 d=6><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>I can't... control my powers...! They're going... out of control...!"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P3722663544" "<t=6 d=6><color white><bgcolor purple>WADE! He did this! He had no intention of freeing me!"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P439089954" "<t=5 d=5><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>Just stay calm, I'll handle this."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P1390265336" "<t=6 d=6><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>I can't... I can barely control the power from killing you...! It's... spreading... my power is affecting everyone in Paragon!"
// 6 Caption :
"P1568430753" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>I can hear their screams... feel their pain... my power is killing them!"
// 6 Caption :
"P2930165631" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>My powers are going to go out of control... killing you and every single person in Paragon!"
// 0 Actor1 :
"P350364011" "<em FemReacttoFloat>"
// 6 Actor2 :
"P457009621" "<t=6 d=6><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>I need you to hang in there! There's a way to stop this!"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P1854191677" "<t=6 d=6><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>NO! There's no more time! It's going to happen at any moment... you KNOW what... you have to do!"
// 3 Actor2 :
"P19057071" "<t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>I'm not killing you!"
// 3 Actor1 :
"P1959329963" "<t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>There's no choice!"
// 3 Actor2 :
"P2705880915" "<t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>I WON'T DO IT!"
// 3 Actor1 :
"P879002288" "<t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>JUSTIN!"
// 1 Actor2 :
"P3651531610" "<em MaleLookuptoLookDown>"
// 3 Actor1 :
"P2542091100" "<em FemHittoFloat>"
// 1 Actor2 :
"P753849491" "<em MaleHoldingFem>"
// 1 Actor1 :
"P544207122" "<em FemFloattoDeath>"

